WEBVTT

00:27.470 --> 00:29.470
THAT TIME I GOT REINCARNATED AS A SLIME

01:41.500 --> 01:42.420
EPISODE 54: APPROACHING THREATS

01:42.420 --> 01:44.000
EPISODE 54: APPROACHING THREATS
Situation report.

01:44.430 --> 01:48.840
A party of five led by Hinata
is heading toward Tempest.

01:48.840 --> 01:50.470
They all appear to be very skilled,

01:50.470 --> 01:52.830
and they escape
the surveillance of Soka's team.

01:53.300 --> 01:54.510
Truly?!

01:54.830 --> 01:58.470
Temple Knights from neighboring nations
are making their move toward Falmuth,

01:58.820 --> 02:01.270
and their number appears
to be over thirty thousand.

02:01.270 --> 02:04.770
Their mission is to take down
the demon who killed the Archbishop.

02:04.770 --> 02:08.940
And the demon that's backing up Sir Youm
is the one who killed the Archbishop.

02:08.940 --> 02:10.870
With that being the story,

02:10.870 --> 02:14.710
we can't expect support from other nations
or any of the powerful nobles in Falmuth.

02:15.280 --> 02:19.660
I was the one who sent Reyhiem
as our envoy. It's my failure.

02:19.660 --> 02:21.080
Exactly!

02:21.080 --> 02:23.040
This is your failure, Diablo.

02:23.040 --> 02:27.880
As your senior, it seems it'd be better
for all of us to have me take command!

02:27.880 --> 02:31.960
So, Shion, what would you do, then?

02:31.960 --> 02:36.340
I would lead an army and go kill all
the royalty and nobility, of course—

02:36.340 --> 02:37.730
No! Definitely no!

02:40.010 --> 02:42.980
Look, Diablo,
everybody makes mistakes.

02:42.980 --> 02:46.980
It's not like it's that big of a deal
you've been found out, right?

02:46.980 --> 02:48.520
What? But...

02:48.910 --> 02:52.530
With all this talk about a demon on the loose,
continuing with the plan will be...

02:52.530 --> 02:57.820
Listen, when you make a mistake,
what's important is to make up for it.

02:58.290 --> 03:02.290
Anyone can just easily quit
when they mess up, all right?

03:02.290 --> 03:03.620
He's right.

03:03.620 --> 03:06.330
As someone who serves Great Rimuru,

03:06.330 --> 03:09.960
you mustn't let small mistakes
get over you.

03:09.960 --> 03:11.920
Well, there you have it.

03:12.360 --> 03:16.300
So you want me to continue
with the plan, then?

03:16.300 --> 03:17.680
Of course.

03:17.680 --> 03:21.100
I want you to handle
this plan to the very end.

03:21.100 --> 03:22.810
Or will that be too much for you?

03:23.250 --> 03:25.810
No, not at all!

03:26.230 --> 03:32.070
You were so kind to give me this work,
so allow me to take it to its conclusion!

03:32.070 --> 03:35.110
Good.
I trust you will make up for this.

03:36.590 --> 03:38.280
Of course!

03:38.280 --> 03:41.740
Great Rimuru,
about the Western Holy Church...

03:42.080 --> 03:46.370
Why don't we seek advice from Adalmann?
He was a high priest of the Luminism.

03:46.690 --> 03:49.330
Adalmann?

03:49.330 --> 03:52.630
Answer. He was the one
who defended Clayman's castle.

03:52.630 --> 03:56.620
Oh! It's the undead guy
Shuna convinced to join us, right?

03:57.520 --> 04:00.640
He's currently working
at the Sealed Cave.

04:00.640 --> 04:04.020
I'll use Thought Communication
to tell him to get here immediately.

04:04.020 --> 04:04.870
Please do.

04:06.020 --> 04:07.850
What a divine grace!

04:08.250 --> 04:09.850
I am humbly delighted.

04:09.850 --> 04:12.940
Allow me to express my joy
at being granted

04:12.940 --> 04:16.280
the tremendous good fortune of
an audience with you, my lord.

04:16.280 --> 04:17.570
That's long!

04:17.570 --> 04:20.240
It is such an honor to hear that.

04:20.240 --> 04:21.410
I wasn't praising you!

04:21.410 --> 04:23.240
You have potential!

04:23.240 --> 04:24.240
I agree.

04:24.870 --> 04:29.270
Adalmann, we're short on time right now,
so please get right to the topic.

04:31.290 --> 04:37.050
I once served as a cardinal
at the Western Holy Church.

04:37.470 --> 04:40.550
Cardinal? Isn't that one
of the highest positions?

04:42.140 --> 04:48.810
The Holy Empire of Lubelius is a religious
state with the god Luminus at the peak

04:49.180 --> 04:53.310
The Holy Emperor is the spokesperson for
their god, and their identity is unknown.

04:53.310 --> 04:57.320
The nation's day-to-day operations
were handled by the Papacy.

04:57.320 --> 05:03.700
In my time, the entire Western Holy Church
was merely a division of this Papacy.

05:04.410 --> 05:06.240
The Western Holy Church

05:06.240 --> 05:09.650
began strictly as a missionary group to
spread the good word about Luminism,

05:09.650 --> 05:12.710
and it had no standing army at all.

05:13.200 --> 05:16.500
And to protect their believers
from monster threats,

05:16.500 --> 05:19.970
the Papacy formed the Temple Knights,

05:19.970 --> 05:22.720
and the world's nations
welcomed their presence.

05:22.720 --> 05:28.390
Friction would then start to grow
in their relationships with foreign nations.

05:28.390 --> 05:32.650
To address that, a division that worked
under direct control of the Holy Emperor,

05:33.010 --> 05:35.150
the Master Rooks, was made.

05:35.150 --> 05:36.730
They all boasted tremendous strength

05:36.730 --> 05:39.860
and had the right to give orders
to the Temple Knights.

05:39.860 --> 05:43.410
Not even the most powerful
consuls in the Papacy

05:43.410 --> 05:46.990
could do more than merely
"request" their services.

05:47.580 --> 05:52.080
Then, after the Church
had acquired the Crusaders,

05:52.080 --> 05:55.590
their influence in the affairs of things
grew stronger.

05:55.590 --> 05:57.250
Why is that?

05:57.250 --> 06:03.590
I believe it had a lot to do with
the presence of the Seven Days Clergy.

06:03.950 --> 06:09.220
When I was there, they were enjoying powers
second only to the Holy Emperor,

06:09.220 --> 06:12.100
but they were extremely fishy to me.

06:12.690 --> 06:15.980
The Church was falling
into depravity day by day,

06:15.980 --> 06:19.400
and not only did they land
a trap on me, but they also...

06:19.400 --> 06:21.860
Sounds like you went through a lot.

06:21.860 --> 06:25.700
Anyhow, Hinata Sakaguchi trained
the Crusaders who were turning

06:25.700 --> 06:29.120
into a former shell of itself
into the strongest knight corps,

06:29.120 --> 06:34.370
And now Lubelius had acquired both
the Master Rooks and the Crusaders.

06:34.740 --> 06:37.000
Please, my lord and savior, be careful.

06:37.000 --> 06:42.380
Lubelius is home to a group of Enlightened
known as the Ten Great Saints.

06:42.380 --> 06:45.340
Enlightened known as the Saints?

06:45.340 --> 06:46.640
Answer.

06:46.640 --> 06:50.680
It's an evolution of humans
who underwent rigorous training.

06:50.680 --> 06:52.600
It's something close
to a Demon Lord Seed.

06:52.600 --> 06:57.650
There are those known as the Three Battlesages
within the Master Rooks.

06:57.650 --> 07:02.090
They, along with six commanders in Crusaders
and Hinata, formed the Ten Great Saints.

07:02.610 --> 07:07.030
Then, the four people who are
heading here along with Hinata are...

07:07.030 --> 07:09.750
They're likely members
of the Ten Great Saints.

07:09.750 --> 07:12.080
If the Temple Knights are on the move,

07:12.080 --> 07:14.870
likely so for the Master Rooks
and Three Battlesages.

07:14.870 --> 07:16.580
My lord!

07:16.580 --> 07:22.380
Please allow me as a former cardinal
to reason with this Hinata woman!

07:22.770 --> 07:26.300
I will convince her to abandon her faith
and turn it toward you instead—

07:26.300 --> 07:29.470
Ah, wait, wait.
I don't need any of that.

07:29.470 --> 07:31.260
You can go now.

07:31.260 --> 07:31.950
What?!

07:33.850 --> 07:36.520
I see.
There is always that approach.

07:36.520 --> 07:38.350
A wonderful idea!

07:38.350 --> 07:39.900
What are you two talking about?!

07:39.900 --> 07:42.110
You're gonna get things
even more complicated!

07:43.940 --> 07:48.410
Now that we have all the info we need,
let's devise some actual policies.

07:49.780 --> 07:51.330
Is it finally my turn?

07:51.330 --> 07:55.040
No, I want you to act
as our final line of defense.

07:55.040 --> 07:55.710
What?!

07:56.080 --> 07:57.920
Doesn't that sound cool?

07:57.920 --> 08:00.040
The final line of defense!

08:00.880 --> 08:04.380
You're the only one who I can entrust
with this important role.

08:04.760 --> 08:06.170
Of course!

08:06.170 --> 08:08.470
I thought so as well!

08:08.470 --> 08:11.260
Awesome. That should prevent him
from going berserk.

08:11.760 --> 08:15.270
I'll announce my assignments
for Sir Youm's reinforcements.

08:15.270 --> 08:19.190
First, a hundred Goblin Riders
led by Gobta.

08:19.190 --> 08:21.110
Four thousand of the Green Numbers,

08:21.110 --> 08:23.860
along with a hundred members
of Team Kurenai that'll lead them.

08:23.860 --> 08:27.150
Lastly, a hundred fighters
from Gabiru's Team Hiryu.

08:27.150 --> 08:30.030
That was a force of 4,300 in total.

08:30.030 --> 08:31.780
Any feedback?

08:31.780 --> 08:33.950
Wait, me?!

08:33.950 --> 08:34.950
Is there a problem?

08:34.950 --> 08:37.960
Uh, no. Not at all...

08:39.080 --> 08:41.210
Hakuro will be the supreme commander.

08:41.210 --> 08:44.040
If anything happens,
I'll back you up at once.

08:44.040 --> 08:45.760
Understood, sir.

08:45.760 --> 08:47.090
Roger that.

08:47.470 --> 08:49.300
Ranga, are you awake?

08:49.300 --> 08:51.260
Are we going somewhere, Master?

08:51.660 --> 08:54.390
I need to get you exercise
every now and then, you know?

08:54.390 --> 08:56.350
Follow Gobta and keep him safe.

08:56.350 --> 08:59.270
If Ranga's joining me,
I'll be totally fine!

08:59.270 --> 09:00.520
It shall be done!

09:00.520 --> 09:03.480
Lady Shion has taught me
how to hold back!

09:06.030 --> 09:09.240
S-So, Diablo, what's your plan this time?

09:09.740 --> 09:12.870
Thirty thousand reinforcements
are well beyond my projections.

09:12.870 --> 09:15.990
My original plan assumed
the new king's force

09:15.990 --> 09:19.290
to be approximately
ten thousand in total.

09:19.960 --> 09:24.130
First, I have Edmaris to send a letter
to the new king Edward

09:24.130 --> 09:27.510
once he began moving his troops around,
asking him to explain his actions.

09:28.400 --> 09:32.930
Then the new king will say he has no obligation
to honor the contract signed by Edmaris,

09:32.930 --> 09:34.600
execute him,

09:34.600 --> 09:37.010
and claim that the agreement
is null and void.

09:37.010 --> 09:39.980
And if it angered us enough
to stage a military operation,

09:39.980 --> 09:43.900
the Western Nations would
join together to resist us.

09:44.360 --> 09:50.110
Edmaris is being protected by Youm's squad
and lying low in Nidol at the moment.

09:50.650 --> 09:53.610
Youm had a force of
five thousand over there,

09:53.610 --> 10:00.160
and the original plan was for us to
teleport 4,300 more there in one go.

10:00.590 --> 10:04.790
But against thirty thousand reinforcements,
it won't mean much.

10:04.790 --> 10:08.380
At worst, we could always
just give up on this.

10:08.380 --> 10:11.880
If I forgive the remaining debt they owe us,
we can avoid the war, right?

10:11.880 --> 10:13.010
We can't!

10:13.010 --> 10:16.120
If we do that, they will think you're
a big pushover, Great Rimuru!

10:17.640 --> 10:19.970
Abandoning the plan would be unthinkable.

10:20.430 --> 10:24.020
Great Rimuru, you are willing
to let me handle this, yes?

10:24.020 --> 10:28.980
Yeah, but I don't want people
who are not involved to die from this.

10:29.390 --> 10:31.150
That will not be a problem.

10:31.150 --> 10:37.530
If that is your will, then it is my duty
as your servant to abide by it.

10:37.530 --> 10:38.990
What are you intending to do?

10:39.620 --> 10:41.830
I will find the culprit.

10:41.830 --> 10:46.000
The fool who tried to pin the crime on me.

10:46.330 --> 10:49.000
Ah, he's pretty angry.

10:49.440 --> 10:54.630
Among these thirty thousand, there could
be someone involved with the culprit.

10:54.630 --> 10:57.510
I will give them a gentle interrogation.

10:57.510 --> 11:02.520
Oh no! There's no shred
of gentleness in his eyes!

11:02.520 --> 11:05.170
If you were to engage them,
we'd have no worries.

11:05.170 --> 11:10.070
Hakuro, can you suppress the new king's
soldiers without killing any of them?

11:10.070 --> 11:12.150
It shouldn't be a problem.

11:12.150 --> 11:12.860
Huh?

11:12.860 --> 11:15.910
It would be easier to stage
a surprise attack to end things quickly,

11:15.910 --> 11:18.530
but that would provide
no training for us.

11:18.530 --> 11:20.280
- Huh?
- True.

11:20.280 --> 11:22.700
Gabiru, we're going to need
a great deal of potion.

11:22.700 --> 11:25.370
- Huh?
- Certainly! I will be sure it is ready.

11:25.370 --> 11:29.380
They're leaving me behind...
Talking things through without me...

11:29.770 --> 11:34.010
Looks like the Falmuth invasion
is in good hands, Great Rimuru!

11:34.010 --> 11:36.630
U-Uh, yeah...
Right.

11:36.630 --> 11:38.430
Good luck, everyone.

11:38.430 --> 11:39.510
Yes, sir!

11:43.970 --> 11:48.020
Now, as for who will be facing
Hinata and her men...

11:48.020 --> 11:50.730
Great Rimuru, we have an emergency.

11:50.730 --> 11:52.650
The Crusaders have begun to move.

11:52.650 --> 11:54.280
Is something up with Hinata's team?

11:54.280 --> 11:58.860
No, according to the report from Hokuso
who was monitoring Engrassia,

11:58.860 --> 12:01.200
a hundred mounted knights
had just departed.

12:01.200 --> 12:02.450
What?!

12:04.040 --> 12:07.460
They're most likely headed here.

12:09.960 --> 12:12.380
Are they trying to meet up with Hinata?

12:12.380 --> 12:13.630
It's unclear.

12:13.630 --> 12:17.090
It will take Hinata at least
two weeks to arrive,

12:17.090 --> 12:20.470
and the knights behind her are likely
to take about the same time.

12:20.470 --> 12:21.800
Hmm.

12:21.800 --> 12:26.480
I can take Hinata myself,
but what to do with the remaining four?

12:26.480 --> 12:30.730
Answer. The sole concern is
the subject Hinata Sakaguchi.

12:30.730 --> 12:32.820
That's the problem here.

12:32.820 --> 12:34.090
Are you all right?

12:34.090 --> 12:37.110
You seem to be less reliable than
when you were Great Sage.

12:39.950 --> 12:41.820
All right! I've got an idea!

12:41.820 --> 12:45.580
How about we say that I just "happen"
to test out my dragon's breath?

12:45.970 --> 12:47.910
We'll simply pretend
it was a misfire!

12:47.910 --> 12:49.120
Can you please shut up?

12:49.120 --> 12:52.580
Do you get your assignment?
You're the final line of defense, all right?

12:52.970 --> 12:56.760
What if Hinata did come to talk,
and we pulled a stunt like that?

12:56.760 --> 13:00.180
Report. That is indeed
the most likely outcome.

13:00.180 --> 13:01.220
Huh?

13:01.220 --> 13:05.720
So there's still a possibility for us
to talk this out?

13:06.560 --> 13:10.270
Shizu-san was also worried about Hinata.

13:10.850 --> 13:14.020
I don't want to start killing people
without hearing them out first.

13:16.070 --> 13:19.530
But if our talk went south, then...

13:20.570 --> 13:22.530
All right, I've decided!

13:22.530 --> 13:26.290
I want you all to avoid killing
any of the Paladins as well.

13:30.080 --> 13:34.330
In short, we just have to slash 'em
all up and silence them, right?

13:34.750 --> 13:36.880
Ah! I-I was just joking!

13:38.380 --> 13:41.010
In short, you want us
to maintain the battle,

13:41.010 --> 13:44.140
without killing any Paladins
or losing anyone on our side.

13:44.140 --> 13:48.140
And in the meantime, you will defeat
the enemy's leader, right, Great Rimuru?

13:48.140 --> 13:49.560
Yeah. That's what it is.

13:49.560 --> 13:51.390
I'm glad you got it.

13:51.390 --> 13:53.480
In that case, I have an idea!

13:53.480 --> 13:54.150
Huh?!

13:54.150 --> 13:55.400
Tell us.

13:55.750 --> 13:59.190
I have exactly one hundred members
in my Team Reborn.

13:59.190 --> 14:01.240
They would certainly be up
to the challenge.

14:01.240 --> 14:03.530
I'd like them to engage the Paladins!

14:03.530 --> 14:07.450
Are you crazy?! Team Reborn's
strength is only about a C rank!

14:07.450 --> 14:10.410
They're not gonna be up
to the challenge.

14:10.410 --> 14:13.460
No, I think it would be an effective plan.

14:13.460 --> 14:14.080
Huh?

14:14.080 --> 14:19.130
Team Reborn has the extra skills,
Complete Memory and Self-Regeneration.

14:19.670 --> 14:22.010
They can take most normal attacks
just fine,

14:22.010 --> 14:25.300
and their weakness would put
the Paladins off their guard.

14:25.840 --> 14:27.720
It would give us a hole to plunge through.

14:27.720 --> 14:30.470
So they're well-suited for buying time?

14:30.880 --> 14:32.390
Exactly!

14:32.390 --> 14:36.400
And if they're in danger, I can send
my Team Kurenai in to help them out.

14:37.150 --> 14:38.770
Gobwa, can you do it?

14:38.770 --> 14:40.020
Yes, sir!

14:40.020 --> 14:42.530
She's Gobwa, the leader of Team Kurenai.

14:42.860 --> 14:46.660
I've been training my squad
just as hard as Lady Shion has.

14:47.050 --> 14:51.660
Please allow us to serve your needs
on the field, Great Rimuru.

14:51.660 --> 14:54.670
All right, I'll have you
handle this, Shion.

14:54.670 --> 14:55.750
Yes, sir!

14:55.750 --> 14:58.500
Gobwa, was it?
Please assist her well.

14:58.500 --> 15:01.670
Yes! I'll try to live up to your
expectations, Great Rimuru!

15:02.010 --> 15:06.010
And all that's left are the four people
who are following Hinata.

15:06.010 --> 15:09.640
Who we have left who can
handle fighting Saints?

15:11.740 --> 15:13.980
I'll handle Hinata.

15:13.980 --> 15:15.560
Veldora is out of the question.

15:15.560 --> 15:17.310
Geld is on hold.

15:17.310 --> 15:22.860
I want to have Diablo, Ranga, Hakuro,
and Gabiru to focus on Falmuth.

15:22.860 --> 15:24.700
In that case...

15:25.200 --> 15:29.410
So the only ones we have free are
Benimaru, Shion, and Soei, huh?

15:29.410 --> 15:31.160
I will join the battle, of course.

15:31.620 --> 15:34.580
My Body Doubles can handle
my intelligence duties well enough,

15:34.580 --> 15:37.920
and Soka and the others are
proving fairly useful by this point.

15:37.920 --> 15:41.340
Me too! As your secretary,
I will forever remain by your side!

15:41.340 --> 15:42.840
Report.

15:42.840 --> 15:46.260
If there is an Enlightened-level
fighter among the Paladins,

15:46.260 --> 15:49.340
it would be safer to devote
some force to them as well.

15:49.690 --> 15:52.470
Oh, yeah. We have
that concern, too, do we?

15:52.470 --> 15:53.890
Hang on, Soei.

15:53.890 --> 15:58.190
Are there any strong guys among
the Paladins, separate from Hinata?

16:00.560 --> 16:03.780
All of them are at least an A rank,

16:04.230 --> 16:06.740
but none particularly
stood out from the pack.

16:07.320 --> 16:11.780
The stronger they are, the better
they are at hiding their presence.

16:11.780 --> 16:14.660
Shion, I want you to monitor
the Paladins, too.

16:14.660 --> 16:17.790
I'll have you command
Team Kurenai as well.

16:17.790 --> 16:19.460
Will that be okay, Benimaru?

16:19.460 --> 16:24.800
Soei and I can each engage two of
Hinata's companions with no problem.

16:25.230 --> 16:26.580
One moment, Great Rimuru!

16:26.580 --> 16:29.220
I believe now would be a good
opportunity for me to join in!

16:29.220 --> 16:29.840
Huh?

16:29.840 --> 16:32.050
In that case, I, too, am available!

16:32.050 --> 16:32.800
Huh?

16:32.800 --> 16:35.560
So am I! I don't want Gobta
to hog all the spotlight!

16:35.560 --> 16:36.980
Ah, hang on, hang on.

16:36.980 --> 16:40.140
I think this is a little too
dangerous for you all.

16:40.140 --> 16:42.690
Wh-What are you doing?
We're in the middle of a meeting!

16:42.690 --> 16:46.150
Yeah, and we want to be part of it!

16:46.150 --> 16:49.450
Stop being so belligerent, Suphia.

16:49.450 --> 16:51.620
Hey! Sorry to barge in!

16:51.620 --> 16:54.950
Let us join in, too, Lord Rimuru.

16:54.950 --> 17:01.000
Demon Lord Rimuru, please allow us
the chance to repay the favor you gave us.

17:01.340 --> 17:03.000
You two will help us?

17:03.000 --> 17:04.040
Yeah!

17:04.040 --> 17:07.880
This is pretty much the only way
we can repay our debt to you.

17:07.880 --> 17:12.510
But can you do that
without Carrion's consent?

17:12.510 --> 17:16.850
I'm sure our lord would yell at us
if we didn't step up here.

17:17.340 --> 17:19.810
I believe we can trust them.

17:19.810 --> 17:20.940
Can you do it?

17:21.270 --> 17:22.310
You can count on us.

17:22.310 --> 17:24.400
Thank you for your kind words!

17:27.150 --> 17:28.910
I'm going to say this one last time.

17:29.400 --> 17:33.410
If it ever seems it'll be hard to
keep things afloat in battle,

17:33.750 --> 17:36.700
I want you to immediately start
to annihilate the enemy.

17:36.700 --> 17:39.370
The lives of our allies
are our top priority.

17:39.370 --> 17:43.380
And you need to understand that this
means nothing if any of you get killed.

17:43.970 --> 17:47.050
I expect everyone to make it through
this alive, just as we always do.

17:47.050 --> 17:47.960
Dismissed!

17:47.960 --> 17:49.130
Yes, sir!

17:57.390 --> 17:59.140
Everything is going as planned.

17:59.520 --> 18:01.640
She's still oblivious to our actions.

18:03.190 --> 18:08.650
Rumors say that witch have a sharp mind,
but turned out she's not that big of a deal.

18:08.650 --> 18:11.400
Still, we cannot let our guard down.

18:11.400 --> 18:17.530
Indeed. Ill-advice artifice
is powerless against brute force.

18:18.010 --> 18:20.040
But Sir Damrada,

18:20.040 --> 18:23.370
I fear your lies have been
uncovered, haven't they?

18:25.630 --> 18:29.130
It is not an issue.
We have earned a great deal in return.

18:29.590 --> 18:33.380
You have my trust, Sir Granville.

18:33.380 --> 18:35.260
Don't you jest.

18:35.260 --> 18:38.010
The East's objective is to orchestrate
a division in the West

18:38.010 --> 18:40.140
and make money off
the ensuing weapon sales.

18:40.140 --> 18:45.020
Then, you'll wait until we're exhausted
and immobilize the Empire, yes?

18:45.020 --> 18:49.020
You see right through me.
I expect no less than you, Sir Granville.

18:50.190 --> 18:51.530
That doesn't matter now.

18:51.530 --> 18:53.280
Let's get back to the main issue.

18:53.720 --> 18:57.280
We both want Hinata to be eliminated.

18:57.280 --> 18:59.240
Am I right?

18:59.240 --> 19:00.540
Of course.

19:01.010 --> 19:03.580
Our biggest obstacle, the Evil Dragon,

19:03.580 --> 19:07.460
has been tamed by the Demon Lord Rimuru
and can be negotiated with.

19:07.460 --> 19:10.420
That opens an opportunity for us.

19:10.420 --> 19:14.300
The next issue is the threat
of the Western Holy Church.

19:14.300 --> 19:17.720
Oh? So we hardly
merit notice from you?

19:17.720 --> 19:19.180
Not at all.

19:19.180 --> 19:22.770
All five of you are intelligent
and understanding of your interests.

19:23.270 --> 19:25.940
After the Empire takes over the West,

19:25.940 --> 19:29.270
I hope we can work together
to control its economy.

19:29.270 --> 19:30.860
Work together?

19:30.860 --> 19:32.280
Don't make me laugh.

19:33.570 --> 19:36.970
Would you much rather oppose us, then?

19:38.120 --> 19:43.660
Such insolence from a mere
weapons merchant, don't you think?

19:43.660 --> 19:45.620
A handgun?

19:45.620 --> 19:49.290
I'm surprised to see them here,
in the West.

19:49.290 --> 19:51.880
Oh, you know what this thing is?

19:52.290 --> 19:54.210
Enough, Glenda.

19:55.510 --> 19:59.390
I do not wish to tilt the balance of power
between Falmuth and Engrassia.

19:59.920 --> 20:03.140
We cannot let that land
be taken by a Demon Lord.

20:03.720 --> 20:10.940
As for me, I do not want to lose the trade
route connecting to the Dwarven Kingdom.

20:10.940 --> 20:15.610
He also defeated Demon Lord Clayman,
who was a valuable trading partner to us.

20:15.610 --> 20:18.240
I bear a grudge against
Demon Lord Rimuru.

20:18.610 --> 20:21.620
I will be glad to work with you, so—

20:21.620 --> 20:23.790
No need to worry about Hinata.

20:23.790 --> 20:26.200
Yeah, no doubt about it.

20:26.200 --> 20:28.790
Hinata already marched right to Tempest.

20:28.790 --> 20:34.710
In that case, I'll eliminate the demon that's
been conspiring within Falmuth, as planned.

20:34.710 --> 20:35.880
Good.

20:35.880 --> 20:40.300
Glenda, work with Edward
and further pressure Edmaris.

20:40.300 --> 20:41.640
Got it.

20:42.070 --> 20:44.760
Knowing that Hinata is heading his way,

20:44.760 --> 20:47.390
Demon Lord Rimuru should
have his hands tied.

20:47.390 --> 20:54.150
But what if Hinata Sakaguchi
actually defeats him?

20:54.150 --> 20:56.320
Do not worry.

20:56.320 --> 20:59.910
Rimuru is not like the other Demon Lords.

21:00.340 --> 21:03.580
He is a dangerous element we will
have to take care of sooner or later,

21:03.580 --> 21:05.540
but we already have a plan
to address that.

21:08.540 --> 21:11.290
I will leave that
in your talented hands, then.

21:13.080 --> 21:16.800
That merchant takes us lightly.
It drives me crazy.

21:17.380 --> 21:19.130
Don't be like that, Glenda.

21:19.720 --> 21:22.430
They are part of
an underground organization

21:22.430 --> 21:25.180
known as Cerberus that ruled
the underworld in the East.

21:26.390 --> 21:31.310
And that man is one of their leaders,
Damrada the Gold.

21:31.310 --> 21:35.150
However, this may not go
so easily for him.

21:35.150 --> 21:40.690
After all, the demon they're dealing with
is no mere Arch Demon.

21:40.690 --> 21:42.570
If it comes to that, I could step up.

21:42.970 --> 21:45.450
I imagine he won't be a problem for you,

21:45.450 --> 21:48.970
but just in case, I'd like to get
the other Battlesages involved as well.

21:50.080 --> 21:53.790
We also need to weaken
Demon Lord Rimuru's underlings, after all.

21:53.790 --> 21:56.710
And even if we fail at that,
we need to do whatever it takes

21:56.710 --> 21:59.210
to ensure the victory
of the allied forces.

21:59.640 --> 22:04.470
Glenda, I want you to use Cerberus
to seal that demon's movements.

22:04.470 --> 22:06.470
Yeah, you got it.

22:06.470 --> 22:10.640
Glenda Attley is on the job.

22:10.640 --> 22:15.520
I already have Blood Shadow
to stir Saare and Grigori into action.

22:15.520 --> 22:16.900
All right.

22:16.900 --> 22:18.900
All for the sake of the Rossos.

22:19.240 --> 22:22.400
And for the sake of my freedom!

22:25.410 --> 22:27.700
Is all of this good for you, Mariabell?

22:27.700 --> 22:31.290
Yes. Very much so, Grandfather.

22:31.290 --> 22:34.960
Demon Lord Rimuru will be too busy
dealing with Saint Hinata.

22:35.400 --> 22:36.250
In the meantime,

22:36.250 --> 22:40.960
the Western Nations will intervene
and put an end to the civil war in Falmuth.

22:41.390 --> 22:43.970
In the name of the new
king Edward, of course.

22:44.510 --> 22:49.100
Then he'll be indebted to you.

22:49.100 --> 22:52.600
That's exactly right, Mariabell.

22:53.100 --> 22:58.610
I won't allow anyone to mess
with the sandbox we rule over.

22:59.900 --> 23:01.990
For the Rossos, the world.

23:02.450 --> 23:04.990
For the Rossos, the world!

24:36.500 --> 24:39.290
Next time, "Holy and Demonic Clash."
